            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<div>This dataset covers is a set of scripts (dofiles) that allow the (re)generation of the results presented in the following publications:</div><div><br></div><div>(1) Tenand, M., Bakx, P. & van Doorslaer, E. (2020). “<strong>Equal long-term care for equal needs with universal and comprehensive coverage? An assessment using Dutch administrative data</strong>”, <strong><i>Health Economics</i></strong><em>, </em>29(4):435–451. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/hec.3994\">https://doi.org/10.1002/hec.3994</a></div><div>(2) Tenand, M., Bakx, P. & van Doorslaer, E. (2020). \"<strong>Eligibility or use? Disentangling the sources of horizontal inequity in home care receipt in the Netherlands</strong>\", <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/journal/10991050&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AFQjCNFJQLLJu2LDg2RjmWg5dGk3PKmVNQ\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><i>Health Economics</i></strong></a>, 29(10):1161-1179. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/hec.4126\">https://doi.org/10.1002/hec.4126</a></div><b></b><div><br></div><div>An overview of the project and of how the files relate to one another can be found in the README, a text file provided here with the dofiles. </div>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
